  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'To roll the dice either click the "Roll Dice" button or click anywhere
    on the map to throw it in the direction of where you click. Click Multiple times
    to increase the force of the throw. When the dice comes to a halt, the Monkey
    will move.


    This free version only contains normal dice rolling. IE you
    will have to wait for Unitys Physics engine to complete the roll of the dice,
    bring it to a halt and collect the result. With the Deterministic Dice Roller
    you will instead decide what the dice will roll(Can be a random number), and
    you will not have to wait for the dice to land until you can progress in your
    code, or know the result.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
